    "body": "Hi @blurhead, I think the first virtualenv (the one in white in your screenshot) is coming from something other than starship. You can test this by running `starship explain` which will display a break down of what starship displays. At a guess it might be added by pyenv-virtualenv which I think you can disable by setting the env var `PYENV_VIRTUALENV_DISABLE_PROMPT` to `1`.",
